cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package or its datasets, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "timss-math: Item-level datasets of the released TIMSS mathematics items, and predictions of their IRT parameters by LLMs and Jev"
abstract: >-
  Item-level datasets built from every TIMSS released mathematics set
  (1995 to 2011, grades 4 and 8, and TIMSS Advanced), with the official IRT
  item parameters attached, and predictions of the IRT parameters of new
  items by an LLM or by Jev, grounded in the most similar calibrated items.
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Ze
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/wang-ze/timss-ai"
keywords:
  - TIMSS
  - mathematics assessment
  - item response theory
  - item parameter prediction
  - large language models
  - Jev
  - retrieval-augmented generation
